00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:44.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
with the board of canvassers
all of this.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:47.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, we've had these
crazy Republicans in Michiga

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:48.982 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
long before Trump.

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:54.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
So this isn't -- it isn't that
they joined Trump's party.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:55.822 line:92%
Trump joined their party.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:58.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
Remember, it was the Republica
governor of Michigan

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:01.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
